# The tracking recipe of base/ours.args (the NablaMimic 0.2.0 defaults) on NablaEngine with absolute actions: the
# joint setpoints are the default pose plus the scaled action, so no reference row enters the action. It is the control
# condition of recovery training (recovery.args). Training length comes from --iters or --hours on the command line.
@base/ours.args
--physics engine
